    "description": "Chief software architect and development manager for global custom applications at American Towers. In my role I am responsible for the design, development, and management of our Windows and web based custom applications. The applications that I am responsible for includes enterprise workflow applications, structural engineering applications, and customer facing web applications. American Tower is a global owner and operator of wireless and broadcast communications infrastructure. \nMy technical background includes extensive experience designing, developing, and managing software products using C++, Visual C++, C#, C, .NET Architecture, React Native, COM, ATL, XML, PHP, ActiveX, Java, HTML, DirectX, Visual Basic, ASP, VBScript, JavaScript, XWindows, SalesForce and UNIX Shell Scripting. Experience developing software on many different platforms including: Windows 10, Windows 7, Windows Server 2019/2016/2012/2008, Embedded, LINUX, and UNIX (HP, DEC, Sun). Extensive experience working on complex software systems using object oriented designs (OOD), multithreading, and design patterns. Extensive experience using Microsoft Word, Microsoft Project, PowerPoint, Microsoft Excel, Microsoft Visio, Microsoft SharePoint, Microsoft InfoPath, Microsoft SharePoint, Lotus Notes, PVCS Version Manager, PVCS Tracker, Microsoft TFS, Rational ClearCase, Rational ClearQuest, JIRA, Subversion and Telelogic DOORS.\n",
